Section 3.2 — Unrestricted Use of Outputs

The User is granted complete, perpetual, worldwide, irrevocable, royalty-free
freedom to use, reproduce, modify, publish, distribute, sublicense, sell,
incorporate, and otherwise exploit their Outputs for any purpose whatsoever —
including, without limitation, personal projects, commercial client work,
monetized content, SaaS products, internal tooling, and resale — with no
requirement of attribution to the Software, the Author, or this License.

Section 3.3 — Scope Clarification

For the avoidance of doubt: the freedom conferred by this Part III applies
exclusively to the textual content of generated Outputs. It does not and shall
not be construed to permit the User to deploy the Software itself, any portion
of its codebase, or its underlying architecture in connection with any
Commercial Purpose. The distinction is precise: you own what the tool produces;
you do not acquire any rights in the tool itself beyond those set out in Part II.

